Thus saith the LORD; Behold, I will raise up against Babylon, and against them that dwell in the midst of them that rise against me, a destroying 

          The Medes and Persians who will destroy them as the wind does the chaff.
         wind;

Thou [art] my 

          He means the Medes and Persians, as before he called the Babylonians his hammer, (Jer_50:23).
         battle axe [and] weapons of war: for with thee will I break in pieces the nations, and with thee will I destroy kingdoms;
